1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
=Godslayer=
(Adapted from the novel Godslayer.)

2
00:00:33,083 --> 00:00:36,125
(Divine Era, Lunisolar Calendar,
First Quarter Moon)

3
00:00:36,791 --> 00:00:38,208
(Three classes of people)

4
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,583
(shall enter the city in order.)

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,083
(Outsiders)

6
00:00:41,333 --> 00:00:42,500
(must pay and prove your identity.)

7
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,208
(Half-monsters)

8
00:00:44,208 --> 00:00:45,333
(must lower their heads
and remain silent.)

9
00:00:45,333 --> 00:00:46,833
- Just entering a city...
- (Disturbers shall be caned.)

10
00:00:46,833 --> 00:00:49,291
- Why are there so many stupid rules?
- (Transgressors shall be punished.)

11
00:00:51,666 --> 00:00:53,000
(When sects pass through,)

12
00:00:53,333 --> 00:00:54,458
(keep your eyes lowered and make way.)

13
00:00:55,166 --> 00:00:56,458
(Those who dare to obstruct them
shall be executed.)

14
00:00:56,916 --> 00:00:58,208
(Those who block their carriages
shall be punished.)

15
00:01:29,300 --> 00:01:30,540
(Qi Hao)

16
00:01:30,540 --> 00:01:31,480
Hahaha!

17
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:41,250
Open

18
00:01:41,250 --> 00:01:43,250
the gates!

19
00:01:48,750 --> 00:01:49,750
Who is that?

20
00:01:49,750 --> 00:01:50,541
Why such a grand entrance?

21
00:01:50,750 --> 00:01:52,250
The Young Master of the Qi Sect.

22
00:01:52,375 --> 00:01:53,250
Qi Hao.

23
00:01:57,500 --> 00:01:58,750
Where's Lu Yuanqing?

24
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:07,300
(Drum Tower)

25
00:02:10,375 --> 00:02:11,208
What business?

26
00:02:13,041 --> 00:02:14,291
I'm registering
for the Ascension Trial.

27
00:02:14,458 --> 00:02:15,500
Register first.

28
00:02:16,541 --> 00:02:17,541
(Lu Yuanqing; Dazedi)
Name and origin.

29
00:02:18,708 --> 00:02:20,666
Another one from Dazedi.

30
00:02:21,416 --> 00:02:22,750
The Ascension Trial

31
00:02:22,791 --> 00:02:23,916
requires teams of three.

32
00:02:24,875 --> 00:02:25,708
You're alone?

33
00:02:26,333 --> 00:02:26,958
Alone.

34
00:02:28,125 --> 00:02:28,916
Fine.

35
00:02:29,333 --> 00:02:31,208
Even one person costs 300 crystals.

36
00:02:31,208 --> 00:02:32,291
It's charged by slot,

37
00:02:32,541 --> 00:02:33,500
not by headcount.

38
00:02:33,875 --> 00:02:35,375
I've heard of the rules
of the Ascension Trial.

39
00:02:35,625 --> 00:02:37,041
No questions asked about one's
background or origin,

40
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:38,500
only survival matters.

41
00:02:38,791 --> 00:02:40,166
I've never heard of a crystal fee.

42
00:02:40,958 --> 00:02:42,000
Rules are rules.

43
00:02:42,583 --> 00:02:43,708
But there are always arrangements.

44
00:02:45,833 --> 00:02:47,541
Don't these things cost crystals?

45
00:02:48,125 --> 00:02:49,333
I don't have that many crystals.

46
00:02:50,583 --> 00:02:52,458
No money, no drum mallet.

47
00:02:52,750 --> 00:02:54,833
No drum mallet, no beating the drum.

48
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:57,333
No drum, no registration.

49
00:03:03,333 --> 00:03:04,166
Hey.

50
00:03:06,083 --> 00:03:07,208
You're from out of town, aren't you?

51
00:03:08,375 --> 00:03:09,250
Trying to earn some crystals?

52
00:03:14,083 --> 00:03:15,041
Know a way?

53
00:03:15,291 --> 00:03:16,541
The two of us meeting here,

54
00:03:16,541 --> 00:03:17,666
that must be fate.

55
00:03:17,916 --> 00:03:18,500
Come with me.

56
00:03:20,041 --> 00:03:21,375
(There's a Blood Arena
in the Undercity.)

57
00:03:21,458 --> 00:03:22,375
(Blood Arena)
(Become a combat slave,)

58
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:23,916
(Blood Arena)
(fight monsters for crystals.)

59
00:03:24,250 --> 00:03:25,958
(Blood Arena)
(Win and take your prize.)

60
00:03:35,083 --> 00:03:37,458
The greatest spectacle in the world.

61
00:03:38,208 --> 00:03:41,458
(Mr. Liu)
The Capital Blood Arena.

62
00:03:41,791 --> 00:03:43,458
(Mr. Liu)
Today's arena features two

63
00:03:43,458 --> 00:03:47,458
First-Rank Mountain Goblins.

64
00:03:47,791 --> 00:03:50,083
The winner earns ten crystals.

65
00:03:50,958 --> 00:03:52,833
Next, a swarm of Second-Rank Foul Rats.

66
00:03:53,125 --> 00:03:54,958
The winner earns twenty crystals.

67
00:03:55,708 --> 00:03:57,416
Three Third-Rank Dark Hornets.

68
00:03:57,416 --> 00:03:59,041
The winner earns thirty crystals.

69
00:03:59,500 --> 00:04:02,333
And finally is the Fourth-Rank Heyu!

70
00:04:02,750 --> 00:04:05,875
This beast has been imprisoned
in the Undercity for three years,

71
00:04:06,458 --> 00:04:10,583
and no one has survived against it!

72
00:04:10,958 --> 00:04:12,375
Now this is going to be interesting.

73
00:04:12,375 --> 00:04:13,791
Whoever defeats Fourth-Rank Heyu,

74
00:04:14,250 --> 00:04:16,916
takes fifty crystals!

75
00:04:16,958 --> 00:04:18,833
Three consecutive rounds today,

76
00:04:18,916 --> 00:04:20,208
and the rules remain unchanged.

77
00:04:20,250 --> 00:04:23,333
Winners collect their crystals
and leave.

78
00:04:23,458 --> 00:04:25,208
Losers

79
00:04:25,333 --> 00:04:27,458
will be collected by the Blood Arena.

80
00:04:27,583 --> 00:04:29,333
One straw mat for your corpse.

81
00:04:30,083 --> 00:04:31,583
Enough talk.

82
00:04:31,625 --> 00:04:32,625
Open the gates!

83
00:04:33,041 --> 00:04:34,791
Release the combat slaves!

84
00:04:45,291 --> 00:04:49,791
Go, Hai!

85
00:04:50,041 --> 00:04:51,875
Don't panic. I'll teach you a trick.

86
00:04:51,958 --> 00:04:53,000
Pick a First-Rank monster.

87
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,083
Ten crystals.

88
00:04:54,083 --> 00:04:55,916
Take the money and leave.
Don't get greedy.

89
00:04:56,208 --> 00:04:57,333
Where are you from?

90
00:04:57,666 --> 00:04:58,458
Dazedi.

91
00:04:58,833 --> 00:05:00,083
Where exactly?

92
00:05:00,458 --> 00:05:01,500
Xianliang Village.

93
00:05:01,666 --> 00:05:02,708
Xianliang Village?

94
00:05:02,958 --> 00:05:04,875
Isn't there someone from your village
who smashed a god statue?

95
00:05:04,958 --> 00:05:06,333
The one who survived being struck
by heavenly thunder?

96
00:05:06,458 --> 00:05:07,250
How do you know?

97
00:05:07,333 --> 00:05:08,500
What a coincidence!

98
00:05:08,625 --> 00:05:09,958
The story about that guy
from your village

99
00:05:10,083 --> 00:05:11,333
has spread all the way here.

100
00:05:11,333 --> 00:05:12,750
We all admire him.

101
00:05:12,750 --> 00:05:13,875
But sadly,

102
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,750
half-monsters like us
who don't have monster power,

103
00:05:15,875 --> 00:05:17,708
no matter how hard we train,
we could never become like him.

104
00:05:18,208 --> 00:05:19,083
You don't have monster power?

105
00:05:19,375 --> 00:05:21,541
No. I trained purely on my own.

106
00:05:21,958 --> 00:05:23,166
In the mines, I carried ore.

107
00:05:23,166 --> 00:05:24,750
Others carried one basket,
but I carried two.

108
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,000
After work,

109
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,583
others went to sleep, I lifted rocks.

110
00:05:27,958 --> 00:05:28,958
After ten years of training,

111
00:05:29,083 --> 00:05:30,500
I can beat a First-Rank monster now.

112
00:05:30,833 --> 00:05:32,250
It's only ten crystals,

113
00:05:32,458 --> 00:05:33,458
but if I save up little by little,

114
00:05:33,458 --> 00:05:35,333
I can bring my mom
and dad to the Capital.

115
00:05:38,666 --> 00:05:40,750
But my dad never believed in me.

116
00:05:42,291 --> 00:05:43,416
Do you fight in the Blood Arena often?

117
00:05:43,541 --> 00:05:45,625
Yeah. Fighting in the Blood Arena

118
00:05:45,625 --> 00:05:46,791
is the only way to move up.

119
00:05:47,416 --> 00:05:48,416
If we don't rise,

120
00:05:48,416 --> 00:05:50,041
we'll just get taken away
and made into monster slaves.

121
00:05:51,666 --> 00:05:53,416
A few of us from my village
came out together.

122
00:05:54,041 --> 00:05:54,750
Except me,

123
00:05:55,583 --> 00:05:56,958
all of them were taken to the Undercity.

124
00:05:57,958 --> 00:05:59,708
A guy even had his arm broken.

125
00:06:01,041 --> 00:06:03,041
If only that guy from Xianliang Village
were here.

126
00:06:04,166 --> 00:06:05,541
He'd definitely stand up for us

127
00:06:05,541 --> 00:06:06,708
and fight for justice.

128
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:08,833
(Tokens revealed!)

129
00:06:12,333 --> 00:06:13,875
Five.

130
00:06:13,875 --> 00:06:14,291
One.

131
00:06:14,291 --> 00:06:15,583
(Heaven No. 1.)

132
00:06:15,791 --> 00:06:17,416
(One.)
(Zhu Ahai.)

133
00:06:18,416 --> 00:06:19,833
(Five.)
(My youngest son is called Zhu Ahai.)

134
00:06:20,291 --> 00:06:22,333
(This sesame cake was made
by his mother.)

135
00:06:22,333 --> 00:06:23,416
(It's his favorite.)

136
00:06:24,500 --> 00:06:25,500
Zhu Ahai.

137
00:06:25,500 --> 00:06:26,458
Go pick.

138
00:06:26,958 --> 00:06:28,541
Which rank will you fight?

139
00:06:28,958 --> 00:06:29,958
I'll fight the First-Rank

140
00:06:30,208 --> 00:06:31,000
Mountain Goblin.

141
00:06:31,208 --> 00:06:32,125
Him again?

142
00:06:32,125 --> 00:06:34,541
Every time he comes here,
he only picks First-Rank monsters.

143
00:06:34,541 --> 00:06:36,291
I thought we'd see some blood
at the start.

144
00:06:36,666 --> 00:06:38,666
But he just keeps picking
the easy fights.

145
00:06:38,791 --> 00:06:41,666
Fighting only First-Rank monsters
every time is getting boring.

146
00:06:41,833 --> 00:06:44,083
If you dare face my Heyu,

147
00:06:44,458 --> 00:06:46,416
just hold out for half an incense stick,

148
00:06:46,708 --> 00:06:48,750
and I'll reward you
with a hundred crystals.

149
00:06:48,875 --> 00:06:49,958
(One hundred crystals.)

150
00:06:50,458 --> 00:06:52,041
(I can bring Mom and Dad here.)

151
00:06:52,291 --> 00:06:54,083
I'll give you one hundred crystals,

152
00:06:54,416 --> 00:06:56,416
and I'll release everyone
from your village.

153
00:06:56,541 --> 00:06:57,041
Really?

154
00:06:57,041 --> 00:06:57,791
Of course.

155
00:06:57,791 --> 00:06:58,291
Ahai!

156
00:06:58,291 --> 00:06:59,041
Okay.

157
00:06:59,041 --> 00:06:59,791
Don't be reckless!

158
00:06:59,791 --> 00:07:01,041
I'll fight the Fourth-Rank Heyu.

159
00:07:02,208 --> 00:07:03,708
(Heaven No. 1)

160
00:07:03,875 --> 00:07:05,750
(enters the arena.)

161
00:07:06,166 --> 00:07:06,958
Ahai!

162
00:07:12,208 --> 00:07:13,041
It's fine.

163
00:07:14,041 --> 00:07:17,041
(Blood Cavern. Open up!)

164
00:09:00,833 --> 00:09:02,416
The time should be up.

165
00:09:02,458 --> 00:09:03,833
Half an incense stick
has already burned out.

166
00:09:04,708 --> 00:09:05,916
It should be over!

167
00:09:06,416 --> 00:09:08,541
Half an incense stick has long passed!

168
00:09:08,833 --> 00:09:09,833
Time's up!

169
00:09:10,041 --> 00:09:11,333
Why hasn't it ended?

170
00:09:11,708 --> 00:09:13,166
Why hasn't it ended?

171
00:09:13,208 --> 00:09:17,666
Yeah, why isn't it over yet?

172
00:09:17,791 --> 00:09:20,208
Young Master Qi, time is up.

173
00:09:20,208 --> 00:09:21,291
Boring.

174
00:09:21,583 --> 00:09:23,458
If every fight ends like this,

175
00:09:23,708 --> 00:09:26,666
we might as well shut down
the Blood Arena.

176
00:09:28,208 --> 00:09:30,708
Yes, yes. You're absolutely right.

177
00:09:31,541 --> 00:09:35,958
No winner yet. Keep fighting!

178
00:09:37,416 --> 00:09:40,583
Hey! Half an incense stick is up!

179
00:09:40,583 --> 00:09:43,291
How can they do this?

180
00:09:43,958 --> 00:09:45,208
It's over!

181
00:09:45,958 --> 00:09:46,791
Hey!

182
00:09:49,666 --> 00:09:50,916
Open the darn gate!

183
00:09:51,083 --> 00:09:52,750
I'm talking to you! You hear me?

184
00:09:52,750 --> 00:09:53,750
Open the gate!

185
00:09:53,750 --> 00:09:55,041
You said half an incense stick!

186
00:09:55,416 --> 00:09:56,583
You're breaking your own rules!

187
00:09:58,791 --> 00:10:00,958
Hey! Time's up!

188
00:10:01,041 --> 00:10:02,416
Open the gate!

189
00:10:02,833 --> 00:10:04,958
Open it!

190
00:10:22,125 --> 00:10:22,958
Mr. Liu,

191
00:10:23,333 --> 00:10:26,958
now this is some entertainment.

192
00:10:27,583 --> 00:10:28,958
Why didn't you stop the fight?

193
00:10:29,458 --> 00:10:31,583
He already held out
for half an incense stick!

194
00:10:31,583 --> 00:10:33,625
What's the arena for
if it doesn't bleed?

195
00:10:34,125 --> 00:10:36,000
My Heyu hasn't had enough fun yet.

196
00:10:36,541 --> 00:10:38,625
Mr. Liu, keep the courses coming.

197
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:42,833
How can anyone fight that thing?
Whoever goes in will die!

198
00:10:44,666 --> 00:10:46,083
Next.

199
00:10:46,500 --> 00:10:48,791
Heaven No. 2.

200
00:10:48,958 --> 00:10:50,166
I... I quit!

201
00:10:50,166 --> 00:10:50,750
I'm not fighting!

202
00:10:50,750 --> 00:10:51,625
I quit!

203
00:10:51,625 --> 00:10:53,416
Me too! I'm out!

204
00:10:53,916 --> 00:10:55,416
The wine isn't finished,

205
00:10:55,416 --> 00:10:57,291
so don't stop serving the food.

206
00:10:57,291 --> 00:10:58,541
I'll do it!

207
00:11:00,125 --> 00:11:01,125
One just died,

208
00:11:01,125 --> 00:11:02,375
and here's another one asking for it.

209
00:11:02,375 --> 00:11:03,416
Look at him.

210
00:11:03,916 --> 00:11:05,750
He's barely enough for the Heyu
to pick its teeth with.

211
00:11:05,791 --> 00:11:06,791
Interesting.

212
00:11:06,791 --> 00:11:09,875
Tonight's wine just got a lot better.

213
00:11:09,875 --> 00:11:12,291
Young Master Qi, according to the draw,

214
00:11:12,291 --> 00:11:13,291
it's not his turn.

215
00:11:13,291 --> 00:11:14,583
Let him fight.

216
00:11:14,958 --> 00:11:17,291
I want to watch him die
with my own eyes.

217
00:11:17,791 --> 00:11:19,291
Heaven No. 2.

218
00:11:19,291 --> 00:11:21,416
Go against the Fourth-Rank Heyu!

219
00:11:21,416 --> 00:11:25,333
Blood Cavern, arise!

220
00:11:29,083 --> 00:11:30,125
Ahai!

221
00:11:37,125 --> 00:11:40,041
Didn't you say you'd only fight
First-Rank monsters?

222
00:11:41,041 --> 00:11:42,291
Why did you have to play the hero?

223
00:11:48,625 --> 00:11:49,791
Your mom made these for you.

224
00:11:50,250 --> 00:11:51,416
She even added an extra handful
of sugar.

225
00:12:02,750 --> 00:12:05,583
I was hoping you'd introduce me

226
00:12:05,583 --> 00:12:08,041
to that guy from your village.

227
00:12:09,666 --> 00:12:10,708
But now...

228
00:12:13,625 --> 00:12:16,791
I guess I'll never get the chance.

229
00:12:18,041 --> 00:12:19,166
Still,

230
00:12:19,666 --> 00:12:20,916
I have no regrets.

231
00:12:21,416 --> 00:12:23,000
I may not have monster power,

232
00:12:24,625 --> 00:12:26,750
but I, Zhu Ahai,

233
00:12:28,333 --> 00:12:29,750
am no coward.

234
00:12:38,750 --> 00:12:40,791
The sesame cake

235
00:12:41,250 --> 00:12:42,208
is sweet.

236
00:12:55,166 --> 00:12:57,333
Zhu Ahai, you did us proud!

237
00:12:57,416 --> 00:13:03,000
You did us proud! You did us proud!

238
00:13:26,125 --> 00:13:28,083
Watch out, kid!

239
00:13:38,750 --> 00:13:40,708
(If only that guy from Xianliang Village
were here.)

240
00:13:40,833 --> 00:13:42,125
(He'd definitely stand up for us)

241
00:13:42,250 --> 00:13:43,458
(and fight for justice.)

242
00:13:47,125 --> 00:13:48,458
(The two of us meeting here,)

243
00:13:48,458 --> 00:13:49,500
(that must be fate.)

244
00:14:09,583 --> 00:14:11,333
So many people need this kind of power.

245
00:14:12,458 --> 00:14:14,208
They just never got the chance.

246
00:14:15,958 --> 00:14:16,833
Then this strike...

247
00:14:18,125 --> 00:14:19,166
I'll make it for them.

248
00:14:43,875 --> 00:14:46,000
(Fighting in the Blood Arena
is the only way to move up.)

249
00:14:46,583 --> 00:14:47,583
(If we don't rise,)

250
00:14:47,583 --> 00:14:49,208
(we'll just get taken away
and made into monster slaves.)

251
00:15:08,375 --> 00:15:12,625
Go! Come on!

252
00:15:26,041 --> 00:15:29,417
This strike is called Blood for Blood.

253
00:15:29,417 --> 00:15:30,833
(This strike is called Blood for Blood.)

254
00:15:34,625 --> 00:15:35,666
I hear

255
00:15:36,041 --> 00:15:38,541
the Qi family are the Defenders
of the Ascension Trial.

256
00:15:39,916 --> 00:15:41,583
Go home and get your neck ready.

257
00:15:42,166 --> 00:15:43,041
Wait for me.

258
00:15:44,041 --> 00:15:45,666
I'm coming for your head.

259
00:15:56,583 --> 00:15:59,041
You broke the rules of the Blood Arena,

260
00:15:59,541 --> 00:16:01,166
and you still want the crystals?

261
00:16:01,416 --> 00:16:02,666
Not happening.

262
00:16:02,666 --> 00:16:03,791
You said it yourself.

263
00:16:04,541 --> 00:16:06,291
In the Blood Arena,
we fight for our lives.

264
00:16:06,416 --> 00:16:08,166
Win, and we walk away with the crystals.

265
00:16:08,166 --> 00:16:09,541
That's exactly what I said.

266
00:16:09,666 --> 00:16:12,333
But I said Heaven No. 2

267
00:16:12,333 --> 00:16:14,041
would fight the Fourth-Rank Heyu.

268
00:16:14,333 --> 00:16:15,666
Are you Heaven No. 2?

269
00:16:20,875 --> 00:16:23,000
You don't follow your own rules!

270
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,791
The Qi family makes the rules.

271
00:16:24,791 --> 00:16:27,000
Whatever Young Master Qi
says is the rule!

272
00:16:27,375 --> 00:16:29,041
Kid, take some advice.

273
00:16:29,125 --> 00:16:30,500
You've crossed the wrong man.

274
00:16:30,500 --> 00:16:32,000
Get out while you still can.

275
00:16:39,375 --> 00:16:40,791
(Among the countless half-monsters,)

276
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:42,625
(pride still lives.)

277
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,375
(We pledge to follow Lu,)

278
00:16:44,416 --> 00:16:45,875
(in life and in death.)

279
00:16:53,916 --> 00:16:56,500
I heard you're entering
the Ascension Trial.

280
00:16:57,375 --> 00:16:58,750
After all these years,

281
00:16:58,791 --> 00:17:01,125
you're the first half-monster to try.

282
00:17:01,208 --> 00:17:03,041
This is everything I've saved
over the years.

283
00:17:03,041 --> 00:17:04,291
Take it.

284
00:17:05,833 --> 00:17:07,541
We've swallowed our anger
for too many years.

285
00:17:07,750 --> 00:17:08,833
And today,

286
00:17:08,833 --> 00:17:10,916
you finally stood up for us.

287
00:17:17,708 --> 00:17:18,666
This is mine.

288
00:17:18,666 --> 00:17:19,666
And this is Ahai's.

289
00:17:21,625 --> 00:17:23,416
Ahai held out for the full half-stick
of incense.

290
00:17:25,583 --> 00:17:26,916
Take mine too!

291
00:17:27,041 --> 00:17:27,791
Mine too!

292
00:17:27,791 --> 00:17:31,458
Mine! And mine!

293
00:17:31,541 --> 00:17:32,916
Ours too!

294
00:17:41,333 --> 00:17:42,500
Kiddo.

295
00:17:42,833 --> 00:17:44,583
The Ascension Trial
takes teams of three.

296
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:46,583
One person costs 300 crystals.

297
00:17:46,750 --> 00:17:48,250
Three people cost the same.

298
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:50,750
Might as well get our money's worth.

299
00:17:52,958 --> 00:17:54,000
This is my fight.

300
00:17:54,333 --> 00:17:55,500
I'll handle it myself.

301
00:17:55,875 --> 00:17:57,500
Your life belongs to the agency now.

302
00:17:57,708 --> 00:18:00,083
Your fight is our fight.

303
00:18:00,833 --> 00:18:02,083
That makes it my fight, too.

304
00:18:02,833 --> 00:18:03,708
If it's Yan's fight,

305
00:18:04,125 --> 00:18:05,333
it's mine too.

306
00:18:33,583 --> 00:18:34,875
The Heaven-Herald Drum

307
00:18:36,208 --> 00:18:39,375
hasn't sounded in years.

308
00:18:40,458 --> 00:18:42,833
(Who seeks ascension?)

309
00:18:43,958 --> 00:18:45,083
(Lu Yuanqing)

310
00:18:45,541 --> 00:18:46,708
(from Dazedi.)

311
00:18:47,250 --> 00:18:49,708
(Yan Jiu of the Redtail
Armed Escort Agency.)

312
00:18:50,041 --> 00:18:51,958
(Duo Mu of the Redtail
Armed Escort Agency.)

313
00:18:53,833 --> 00:18:54,200
We challenge!

314
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:58,333
=Episode 5=
(The Challenge)
